WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.350
[Upbeat electronic music]

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.912
Movie night, upgraded. Meet Minova Cinema.
Your Plex library, built for the big screen.

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:12.513
Start with a cinematic home screen.
Explore featured

00:00:12.525 --> 00:00:16.488
movies with the real posters and backdrops
from your own Plex server.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:20.375
Jump back into Continue Watching,
or explore new

00:00:20.375 --> 00:00:23.650
arrivals and personalized shelves
with your TV remote.

00:00:26.138 --> 00:00:28.838
In the mood for action? Or animation? Choose

00:00:28.838 --> 00:00:31.550
a genre and your movie collection
is right there.

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:36.475
Prefer the big picture? Switch to grid view.

00:00:36.875 --> 00:00:39.838
Then jump through your library
with the A-to-Z shortcut.

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:45.338
Keep movies and series separate.
Open a show,

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:48.287
browse its seasons,
and find the episode you want.

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:54.100
Save something for later.
Your Plex watchlist brings

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:57.438
your next movie-night choices together
in one place.

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:01.850
Go beyond the poster.
Explore the story, cast,

00:01:02.038 --> 00:01:04.750
and media details
before choosing what to watch.

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:08.925
During playback, bring up the timeline,
choose audio

00:01:08.925 --> 00:01:12.550
and subtitles, and check exactly
how your media is playing.

00:01:13.538 --> 00:01:15.862
Make it yours in the Control Room.
Customize

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:20.825
autoplay, adjust the ambient screensaver,
and set your viewing reminders.

00:01:21.850 --> 00:01:24.725
Build your movie-night ritual
with Cinema Mode. Choose

00:01:24.738 --> 00:01:28.925
optional pre-shows and configure supported
smart lights for your cinema room.

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:33.962
Your server. Your screen. Your movie night.
Minova

00:01:33.962 --> 00:01:36.812
Cinema. Find it on GitHub and press play.

00:01:36.812 --> 00:01:40.300
[Music fades out]
